   "key": "wealth2"
  },
  {
   "s": 51.1,
   "e": 55.4,
   "text": "And for whom none of that is sufficient\u2026",
   "key": "none"
  },
  {
   "s": 55.5,
   "e": 60.3,
   "text": "\u2026the Fire will surely be sufficient for him.",
   "key": "fire"
  },
  {
   "s": 68.0,
   "e": 69.3,
   "text": "O son of Adam,",
   "key": "adam"
  },
  {
   "s": 77.0,
   "e": 80.4,
   "text": "we weep over this lower life,",
   "key": "weep"
  },
  {
   "s": 84.0,
   "e": 90.6,
   "text": "but there has never been a gathering that death did not separate.",
   "key": "separate"
  },
  {
   "s": 93.9,
   "e": 99.3,
   "text": "Where are the mighty tyrants who amassed treasures?",
   "key": "tyrants"
  },
  {
   "s": 99.5,
   "e": 102.2,
   "text": "They did not survive, nor did their treasures.",
   "key": "survive"
  },
  {
   "s": 103.4,
   "e": 107.6,
   "text": "Where is the one who filled the wide sky with his army?",
   "key": "army"
  },
  {
   "s": 107.6,
   "e": 112.0,
   "text": "In the end, he ended in a narrow grave.",
   "key": "grave"
  },
  {
   "s": 113.0,
   "e": 121.0,
   "text": "When they are called, they will be silent, as if they never knew how to speak.",
   "key": "silent"
  },
  {
   "s": 122.1,
   "e": 130.0,
   "text": "\u201cThose who believe, and whose hearts find peace in the remembrance of Allah.\u201d",
   "key": "believe"
  },
  {
   "s": 130.6,
   "e": 137.4,
   "text": "\u201cVerily, in the remembrance of Allah do hearts find peace.\u201d",
